 and the current president of the school. She loves the school and its students, and has a strong desire to lead everyone and improve the school."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c69725"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"北小路学園学生会三会長の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おしとやかだが律儀で規律正しい大和撫子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"前理事長の孫娘にして現理事長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園と学生を愛し、みんなをよりよく導きたい、学園をよりよくしたいという想いが強い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19785","sourceWorkId":"26656","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"北小路学園学生会三会長の一人。 おしとやかだが律儀で規律正しい大和撫子。 前理事長の孫娘にして現理事長。 学園と学生を愛し、みんなをよりよく導きたい、学園をよりよくしたいという想いが強い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"195566"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fee528a9baae95b072a7cf9903ff79eb667960b7e35a92a8663612944aea5d77.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d9/d9773445519fc8ad03f495db6d7f20ba2ab3309a5c6c281d4d769603083c3c28.webp","width":212,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"風鈴みすず","creatorId":"vndb:s12799","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s12799","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12799","name":"日向 結希","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:264858:195566:26471:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c69726","characterName":"住井 氷華","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"195567","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"264858"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19786"],"vndbCharacterId":"c69726"},"originalCharacterName":"住井 氷華","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the three presidents of the Kitakoji Academy Student Association. She is a wealthy young lady. She is a genius and a brilliant person, but is easily bored. She is cool and high spirited. She leaves everything to her cronies except what she enjoys doing. She treats the protagonist, an incompetent man, as a trashy insect."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c69726"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"北小路学園学生会三会長の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大金持ちのお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天才肌で優秀だが飽きっぽい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クールで高飛車。自分が楽しむこと以外は取り巻きに全て任せている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無能な男＝主人公をゴミ虫扱いしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19786","sourceWorkId":"26656","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"北小路学園学生会三会長の一人。 大金持ちのお嬢様。 天才肌で優秀だが飽きっぽい。 クールで高飛車。自分が楽しむこと以外は取り巻きに全て任せている。 無能な男＝主人公をゴミ虫扱いしている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"195567"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c7c7b31324065affd99a0224bb67e5fe0009ccbcccb172b3b7c50e965a3273d3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e7/e7706131ffbd66e00b4c956ddf005978715d6ec10ee0425ab0a32d49a54939df.webp","width":212,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"風花ましろ","creatorId":"vndb:s5762","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5762","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5762","name":"中野 純花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:264858:195567:20833:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c69727","characterName":"伊庭 茜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"195568","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"264858"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19787"],"vndbCharacterId":"c69727"},"originalCharacterName":"伊庭 茜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the three presidents of the Kitakoji Academy Student Association. She is the stepsister of the main character. She is a hard-working, serious and stoic person. An exemplary honor student. She is a model honor student and strongly admires Wakana, and together they are in charge of enforcing public morals in order to make the school a better place to live. She is strict with the protagonist, who is sloppy, but tries to get him to be decent as a member of her family."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c69727"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"北小路学園学生会三会長の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の義妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お堅く真面目でストイック。模範的な優等生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"和奏を強く慕っていて一緒によりよい学園を作ろうと風紀の取締を担っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だらしがない主人公には手厳しいながら身内としてまともになってもらおうとしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19787","sourceWorkId":"26656","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"北小路学園学生会三会長の一人。 主人公の義妹。 お堅く真面目でストイック。模範的な優等生。 和奏を強く慕っていて一緒によりよい学園を作ろうと風紀の取締を担っている。 だらしがない主人公には手厳しいながら身内としてまともになってもらおうとしている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"195568"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ce/ce960710fd840499c9e057ade0cd696820ce26d2602129ab02150a4faa4ba8d3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c0/c0a61e0fb6642de58a88d731339fba633b2b5bf9308a29ae71b8a8413f621a7e.webp","width":212,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"八ッ橋きなこ","creatorId":"vndb:s353","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s353","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s353","name":"八ッ橋きなこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:264858:195568:16170:1","source":"bangumi"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p918","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:2797","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p918","name":"Miel","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":